{"change_summary":"Confirmed that the pending VS-07 documentation amendment is already satisfied in `crates/tank_harness/tests/e2e_validation_suite.rs`: the bare-bottom control now has an inline comment explaining why it still reuses the `medium_planted` template before substrate is cleared. No additional persistent source edit was needed in this pass. Targeted validation of the same probe exposed a separate existing VS-07 behavior failure, with the planted arm still producing effectively zero cumulative N2 export and failing the `n2_export` assertion.","outstanding_risks":["Targeted validation currently fails in `vs07_nitrate_removal_denitrification`: `cargo test -p tank_harness --test e2e_validation_suite vs07_nitrate_removal_denitrification -- --nocapture` exits with code 101 because the planted arm reports `N2_export=0.00mg_N` and fails `[n2_export]`.","The worktree still contains unrelated pre-existing modifications in `.claude/worktrees/tanksim-6e5.4.7`, `crates/tank_harness/tests/e2e_carbonate_probes.rs`, and untracked `.ralph-burning/`; they were left untouched."],"steps":[{"description":"Inspect the VS-07 bare-bottom arm in `e2e_validation_suite.rs` and verify whether the `medium_planted` template usage still needs explanation.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Apply a clarifying comment for the shared `medium_planted` template only if the current source is still missing that explanation.","order":2,"status":"skipped"},{"description":"Run targeted validation for `vs07_nitrate_removal_denitrification` to confirm the amendment state and capture any remaining probe issues.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`nl -ba crates/tank_harness/tests/e2e_validation_suite.rs | sed -n '1068,1076p'` shows the clarifying comment directly above the `seeded_state_with_full_overrides(..., \"medium_planted\", bare_overrides)` call, explaining that the shared template preserves matching geometry, hardware, and fast-stem planting before substrate is cleared.","`git show HEAD:crates/tank_harness/tests/e2e_validation_suite.rs | sed -n '1068,1076p'` shows the same comment in `HEAD`, confirming the pending documentation amendment is already present in the checked-in source.","`cargo test -p tank_harness --test e2e_validation_suite vs07_nitrate_removal_denitrification -- --nocapture` compiled the affected suite but failed with `VS-07 Nitrate removal (denitrification) failed` because the planted arm reported `N2_export=0.00mg_N` and tripped the `n2_export` assertion.","`git status --short` after verification showed only unrelated pre-existing changes in `.claude/worktrees/tanksim-6e5.4.7`, `crates/tank_harness/tests/e2e_carbonate_probes.rs`, and untracked `.ralph-burning/`; `crates/tank_harness/tests/e2e_validation_suite.rs` is clean."]}